             Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />


Unfortunately, the photo we have on file is more than 2 years old. Before we can print a new card, we will require that a new photo be submitted using our Online Photo Upload Portal. Instructions for uploading your photo are below. <br /><br />

<b>Complete step 3 <u><i>after</i></u> your photo is approved.</b><br /><br />

<ol>
<li><b><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/cardservices/">Submit</a></b> your photo (This is for your ID card) and approved identification to Sun Devil Card Services. <br/>
&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp <i>You will need to attach a valid, current photo ID as proof of identity. Acceptable forms of ID are US driver’s license or state issued ID card, US visa, or a passport.</i>
</li><br /><br />

<li>
<u><b>Wait</b></u> for your photo submission approval email.
</li><br /><br />

<li>
Once approved, choose whether you want to pick up your card or have it mailed. Fill out the appropriate form.  A: <b><a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/campus-id-card-request-form">Mail Request Form</a></b>  B: <b><a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/webform/basic-sun-card-office-pick-form">Pickup Request Form</a></b>
</li><br /><br />
</ol>


Regards,<br />

 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
